      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `4a0628c4589160ee130c604e339d9874dd1b18e4e41884937d3906f316747e5c--CabonneLGA.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: BOCSAR — Crime statistics by LGA (NSW Bureau of Crime Statistics and Research)\n- Release or year: Current file checked 2026-11-01\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Summary of offences\" | 39a4044734ffbe025b015c5103be8f4be8f96c265fd9c8081c76ab69ecc49439 | missing |\n| \"Premises Type\" | 44bf3eb96b6e2afecd81243519b1db648abd3cd9dd14caf44730306f808a553c | missing |\n| \"Victims\" | 6c8a2d99d8d0fba3d20673878b9ccdcf19409ae90ac8b28132c3f43609d581b1 | missing |\n| \"Offenders\" | a01d5f47808ac6b578422385203c6a6c94e0a99e93ac85f902457263c25b6a77 | missing |\n| \"Alcohol Related\" | 77de2833b23781e77d9dc077b4c2dcc5246e89ae3f548cd796a58414d1682913 | missing |\n| \"Month\" | 0f1cab2666b4aa86e8108d237d637f207b891b3f48f42a36a85f9197250b344d | missing |\n| \"Time\" | 5e54389a85a50ebe2790cb09f23dcce88e3f5b2b1ee70cc0e40db5ebe7b5e795 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
